  "description": "XOFKIQ crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C132 H145 Al9 N27 Nd7 O79 2+,C2 H3 N1,2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2A (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2B (Nd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.883-3.883 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.01-102.67°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C134H148Al9Nd7N30O85.",
